    {
      "id": "PB02",
      "finding": "RepeatCount measures completed recipe iterations, not individual output units. Notify_IterationCompleted decrements positive repeatCount and emits completion at zero without deleting the bill. Production generates all products, consumes ingredients, then calls that notification. Core CookMealSimpleBulk yields four meals per iteration.",
      "xml": [
        "PBX03"
      ],
