            207,
            243
          ],
          "excerpt_sha256": "0ae0cc353767cd875ea0c59a5ed98455e3b68a895b58c805ae272581e1da5d00"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PB04",
      "finding": "The details UI exposes pauseWhenSatisfied and unpauseWhenYouHave only in TargetCount, nudges the resume threshold by target changes, and clamps a resume value >=target to target-1. Automatic paused and manual suspended are distinct. The status Unpause action clears paused; subsequent ShouldDoNow can pause again if count still reaches target. Raw target0 may produce resume-1 in this UI path; do not infer a universal nonnegative invariant.",
      "xml": [],
