    {
      "id": "PB05",
      "finding": "BillStack is an ordered list. Add appends and assigns stack; Reorder removes/reinserts the same bill. The listing offers Add while Count<15 and bill UI exposes bounded up/down actions. AddBill itself does not enforce MaxCount and Reorder itself does not guard excessive positive offsets; the observed cap/bounds belong to player UI.",
