    {
      "id": "PB06",
      "finding": "WorkGiver_DoBill scans bills in list order, skips unsuitable work type, ingredient retry cooldown, ShouldDoNow false, pawn restrictions and recipe skill failures. Missing ingredients and a UFT bound to another worker also continue to later bills. It returns on a selected new/continuation job; a blocked first bill does not generally block the whole stack.",
      "xml": [],
      "sources": [
