    {
      "id": "PB07",
      "finding": "JobDriver_DoBill globally fails for deleted/dereferenced bill or unusable bill giver and reserves one bill giver. Manual suspended is separately a DoRecipeWork fail condition, so it interrupts the work stage; the inspected global condition has no suspended check during ingredient collection. Changing a bill is not equivalent to immediately cancelling every phase.",
