    {
      "id": "PB09",
      "finding": "Default generic product counting uses ResourceCounter plus carried products only when CountAsResource, no equipped/include-group/material restriction and full quality/HP ranges (with the additional tainted-apparel condition). ResourceCounter enumerates held things of map slot groups, counts stacks of fresh/nonfogged resources, and refreshes periodically every204ticks. This fast path is not all loose objects anywhere on the map; it does not test forbidden or reachability.",
