    {
      "id": "PB10",
      "finding": "Generic carried-product counting iterates spawned pawns in the player faction, checks carryTracker.CarriedThing after unwrapping minified content, and adds carried wrapper stackCount if valid. It is not all inventory and not just free colonists. The counter does not add promised output of active bills or unfinished-product ingredients.",
      "xml": [],
      "sources": [
        {
          "group": "stonecutting",
          "type": "Verse.RecipeWorkerCounter",
