    {
      "id": "PB11",
      "finding": "The generic slow path without includeGroup scans map things of the product def, minified products, carried items and directly held things of haul sources. With includeGroup it enumerates that slot/group HeldThings. includeEquipped additionally scans free spawned colonists equipment, worn apparel and inventories even when includeGroup is selected. These scopes differ from the fast ResourceCounter path.",
