    {
      "id": "PB12",
      "finding": "CountValidThing checks exact product def, tainted apparel, HP range, quality, allowed stuff when enabled, and fog; it does not check forbidden or path reachability. The List<Thing> CountValidThings overload increments one per valid object while the ThingOwner and slot paths sum stackCount. This derived asymmetry is retained as an unverified edge case, not assumed corrected or universally applied.",
