    {
      "id": "PB13",
      "finding": "Make_StoneBlocksAny selects RecipeWorkerCounter_MakeStoneBlocks in Core XML. This custom CountProducts sums ResourceCounter across all StoneBlocks child defs, without calling the generic counter, adding carried count, or inspecting includeGroup/equipped/HP/quality/material flags. Its recipe target adjustment is20. Do not transfer this counting rule to individual-stone or other recipes without checking their worker counter.",
