      "id": "PB14",
      "finding": "Product-count includeGroup and product-delivery storeGroup are separate settings. Details UI offers include-from-all or a slot/group; output mode offers BestStockpile, SpecificStockpile or DropOnFloor. StorageGroup choices are deduplicated in the selector, and compatibility uses recipe.WorkerCounter.CanPossiblyStore. Invalid referenced output group causes DropOnFloor fallback; invalid includeGroup is cleared separately.",
