    "Derived C# is not original source; unresolved dependencies are tolerated.",
    "Core XML is not an evaluated mod/DLC Def database.",
    "This collector does not run RimWorld or prove UI/runtime timing.",
    "Suspension during collection, active-job reorder preemption, target changes mid-batch, UFT rebinding and save/load need dedicated runtime checks.",
